Third-party notices for @mermaid-js/diagram-treemap
===================================================

d3-hierarchy
------------

The files below re-implement, step for step, d3-hierarchy's `hierarchy`, `sum`, `sort` and
`treemap` with `treemapSquarify`, `treemapDice`, `treemapSlice` and `treemapRound`
(https://github.com/d3/d3-hierarchy, release 3.1.2, as mermaid@12.2.0 resolves it); `sum.ts`
holds the step of `sum` at one node, which hover shares. Their headers say what changed.
d3-hierarchy is used under the ISC License:

  src/layout/tiles.ts
  src/sum.ts

